{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54722","headline":"兵要望江南 占月第十二（京本列第七○二十三首） 四 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 占月第十二（京本列第七○二十三首） 四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"占夜月，五色气相当。\n此是（京本作「时」）交兵须谨（京本作「警」）慎，直须拚（京本作「挨」）得赏儿郎，悭吝必相伤。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54722.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54722","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}